  "description": "Pure-managed, async-first C# client for the EOD Historical Data (EODHD) API. REST coverage for end-of-day and intraday prices, fundamentals, dividends and splits, exchanges, and the calendar — plus the Live (WebSocket) API. Zero runtime dependencies — works on any .NET 8+ runtime.",
