  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.2 — RequestRateLimiter fixes. Dispose (and so EodhdClient.Dispose) no longer blocks for up to a\nminute waiting out the refill loop's pending delay. Refill timing now uses elapsed TimeSpans in 64-bit\nmath: it previously read Stopwatch ticks as TimeSpan ticks, refilling about 100x too fast wherever\nStopwatch.Frequency is not 10 MHz (e.g. Linux), and could overflow at 28 requests/minute or fewer.\n\nFull history: https://github.com/mrut2pac/EODHD.CSharpApiClient/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
